<p>Your Iron Will improves your stun immunity by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 20%, 26%, 31%, 35%</acronym> and gives you a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13%, 18%, 21%, 24%, 26%</acronym> chance of recovering from a random mental effect each turn.</p>